## 🔄 How It Works

```text
        Browser
           │
           ▼
   Request Location
           │
           ▼
    User Permission
       ┌───┴───┐
       │       │
     Allow    Deny
       │       │
       ▼       ▼
 Latitude   Permission
 Longitude    Error
       │
       ▼
   Flask Backend
       │
       ▼
 Reverse Geocoding
       │
       ▼
 Approximate Address
       │
       ▼
   Result Page
```

